{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 39, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was an unforgettable experience. As soon as I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the vibrant energy of the city. Tokyo's neon lights and bustling streets were a sensory overload, but in the best possible way.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market. Watching the fishermen auction off the day's catch was a thrilling experience, and sampling some of the freshest sushi I've ever had was a culinary delight.\n\nI also had the opportunity to explore Japan's rich cultural heritage. Visiting the Meiji Shrine, a serene Shinto temple located in a tranquil forested area, was a peaceful respite from the hustle and bustle of the city. The shrine's beautiful gardens and traditional architecture were a testament to Japan's enduring cultural traditions.\n\nAs I traveled through Japan, I was struck by the country's unique blend of traditional and modern culture. From ancient temples to cutting-edge technology, Japan seamlessly blends old and new. Whether I was sipping matcha tea in a traditional tea house or riding the bullet train at breakneck speeds, I was constantly amazed by the country's contrasts.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was an incredible adventure that left me with unforgettable memories and a deep appreciation for this fascinating country. I'm already planning my next trip back!", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.4958435297012329}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.005319251213222742}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -7.271740287251305e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " an", "logprob": -1.7039963006973267}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0016384999034926295}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.16027508676052094}, {"token": ".",